--- requirements.md ---
order(graph) returns dependencies before dependents once each, traversing graph keys and dependency lists in their insertion order. Graph nodes are strings; every dependency is also a key. Empty graphs are valid. Cycles must raise ValueError("cyclic dependency"), not exhaust recursion. Deep acyclic graphs, missing-node policy and concurrent mutation are out of scope. The working fix already exists; this ticket asks only for retrospective verification with the same current tests.

